<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.92 vs   2.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.27 vs   2.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.75 vs   1.26</p>
<p> Sales		   30.62 vs  23.64</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.76 vs   4.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.12 vs   4.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.16 vs   1.56</p>
<p> Sales		   69.38 vs  55.63</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Budimex</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
